{"words": [{"text": "إِنَّمَا", "translation": "Only"}, {"text": "يُرِيدُ", "translation": "intends"}, {"text": "ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنُ", "translation": "the Shaitaan"}, {"text": "أَن", "translation": "to"}, {"text": "يُوقِعَ", "translation": "cause"}, {"text": "بَيْنَكُمُ", "translation": "between you"}, {"text": "ٱلْعَدَٰوَةَ", "translation": "[the] enmity"}, {"text": "وَٱلْبَغْضَآءَ", "translation": "and [the] hatred"}, {"text": "فِى", "translation": "through"}, {"text": "ٱلْخَمْرِ", "translation": "intoxicants"}, {"text": "وَٱلْمَيْسِرِ", "translation": "and gambling"}, {"text": "وَيَصُدَّكُمْ", "translation": "and hinders you"}, {"text": "عَن", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "ذِكْرِ", "translation": "(the) remembrance"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ", "translation": "(of) Allah"}, {"text": "وَعَنِ", "translation": "and from"}, {"text": "ٱلصَّلَوٰةِ ۖ", "translation": "the prayer"}, {"text": "فَهَلْ", "translation": "So will"}, {"text": "أَنتُم", "translation": "you"}, {"text": "مُّنتَهُونَ", "translation": "(be) the ones who abstain"}], "sahih": "Satan only wants to cause between you animosity and hatred through intoxicants and gambling and to avert you from the remembrance of Allāh and from prayer. So will you not desist?"}